scenario a person walking is not a detection
describe The negative control, and the most important trace in the directory.
describe A detector that fires on ordinary movement is worse than no detector:
describe it trains the wearer to ignore the warning that matters. Ten minutes of
describe walking at about 1.4 m/s, with the accelerometer agreeing.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 4000
  sats 10 13
  hdop 100
  speed 1400
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving
  expect trust trusted

at 60000
  fix 3d
  pos 5007540 10000000
  alt 42100
  acc 4000
  sats 10 13
  hdop 100
  speed 1400
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving
  expect trust trusted
  expect no-reason position-jump
  expect no-reason motion-disagreement

at 120000
  fix 3d
  pos 5015080 10000000
  alt 42200
  acc 4200
  sats 10 13
  hdop 105
  speed 1400
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving
  expect trust trusted
  expect no-reason position-jump

at 300000
  fix 3d
